msgid ""
"Cuando un instrumento FM lleva 8 notas, se toca a escondidas junto a cada instrumento de\n"
"su familia en el SoundFont (bajos, pianos, metales...) y suena el más parecido.\n"
"Los que elijas a mano en el Editor de instrumentos no cambian."
msgstr ""
"When an FM instrument has played 8 notes, it is played unheard next to each instrument of\n"
"its family in the SoundFont (basses, pianos, brass...) and the closest one is heard.\n"
"The ones you choose by hand in the Instrument editor do not change."

