"Gatillo: clic izquierdo o A. Disparar fuera de la pantalla (recargar): clic derecho o C.\n"
"Start: clic central o Start. Botones A y B de la Menacer: B y X del mando.\n"
"Los juegos que la usan (Corpse Killer, Crime Patrol, Mad Dog McCree, Lethal Enforcers...)\n"
"la tienen ya en el puerto 2 si ahí hay un mando.\n"
"Solo los juegos de Mega Drive y Mega CD; en una partida en red se enchufa un mando."
msgstr ""
"A light gun in the second port, instead of pad 2: Sega's Menacer (T2: The Arcade Game,\n"
"Menacer 6-Game Cartridge...) or Konami's Justifier (Lethal Enforcers I and II, Snatcher),\n"
"which has a second gun for player 2. You aim with a crosshair on screen, moved with the\n"
"mouse or with the pad's left stick (or d-pad).\n"
"Trigger: left click or A. Shoot off the screen (reload): right click or C.\n"
"Start: middle click or Start. The Menacer's A and B buttons: B and X on the pad.\n"
"The games that use one (Corpse Killer, Crime Patrol, Mad Dog McCree, Lethal Enforcers...)\n"
"already have it in port 2 if a pad is there.\n"
"Mega Drive and Mega CD games only; in a netplay game a pad is plugged in."

